<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan April foreign reserves fall to $1.567 bln.</title>
<headline>Pakistan April foreign reserves fall to $1.567 bln.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-05-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the monthly foreign exchange reserves holdings position in Pakistan:</p>
<p>    (BLN DLRS)		 APRIL     MARCH     APRIL 1996</p>
<p>    TOTAL			1.567     1.623     2.255</p>
<p>    Forex in Pakistan	0.691     0.561     1.265</p>
<p>    Forex outside Pakistan 0.191     0.384     0.281</p>
<p>    Gold coins and bullion 0.674     0.676     0.697</p>
<p>    Special Drawing Rights 0.011     0.002     0.012</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
